om2
note capget writes its header (capset too: the kernel stores its version): a view parameter is error 20
fn f t view uchar * to long
r = capget t 0 32
ret r
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 64 0
r = f a
ret 0
end
note gate-pools: uses capget on purpose: owner=seed/host/container/check.sh generated refusal qualification
